#. module: stock_owner_restriction_mrp
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/stock_owner_restriction_mrp/models/stock_move.py:0
msgid ""
"%(production)s consumes components of more than one owner: %(owners)s. What "
"comes out of it cannot belong partly to each, so split it into one "
"manufacturing order per owner."
msgstr ""
"%(production)s consume componentes de más de un propietario: %(owners)s. Lo "
"que sale de ella no puede pertenecer en parte a cada uno, así que divídala "
"en una orden de fabricación por propietario."

#. module: stock_owner_restriction_mrp
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/stock_owner_restriction_mrp/models/stock_move.py:0
msgid ""
"%(production)s is set to consume unowned stock only, but these components "
"belong to %(owners)s. Free the stock or change the operation type "
"restriction before validating."
msgstr ""
"%(production)s está configurada para consumir solo existencias sin "
"propietario, pero estos componentes pertenecen a %(owners)s. Libere las "
"existencias o cambie la restricción del tipo de operación antes de validar."

#. module: stock_owner_restriction_mrp
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/stock_owner_restriction_mrp/models/stock_move.py:0
msgid ""
"%(production)s mixes components of %(owner)s with the company's own, and its"
" operation type restricts it to the partner's stock. What comes out of it "
"cannot belong partly to each: split it, or allow unassigned stock on the "
"operation type."
msgstr ""
"%(production)s mezcla componentes de %(owner)s con existencias propias, y su"
" tipo de operación la restringe a las del partner. Lo que sale de ella no "
"puede pertenecer en parte a cada uno: divídala, o permita existencias sin "
"asignar en el tipo de operación."

#. module: stock_owner_restriction_mrp
#: model:ir.model,name:stock_owner_restriction_mrp.model_stock_move
msgid "Stock Move"
msgstr "Movimiento de existencias"
